                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4cb8f82-1cae-3207-81a5-4b4e581e969d",
                                        "entry_id": "6c78eb4b-8825-34e1-b806-bf7f0bae66dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express great approval (for)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aef7450c-08b7-4777-b58c-32d6f297b67e",
                                                "sense_id": "d4cb8f82-1cae-3207-81a5-4b4e581e969d",
                                                "text": "a highly-acclaimed novel"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a079e3b2-8e9e-4fff-bfa5-7eaee696f0e7",
                                                "sense_id": "d4cb8f82-1cae-3207-81a5-4b4e581e969d",
                                                "text": "a widely-acclaimed article"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08abbe07-14bc-4480-9928-f87235ad785d",
                                                "sense_id": "d4cb8f82-1cae-3207-81a5-4b4e581e969d",
                                                "text": "The design, when finally developed, was a slight disappointment to Monsieur Deplis, who had suspected Icarus of being a fortress taken by Wallenstein in the Thirty Years' War, but he was more than satisfied with the execution of the work, which was acclaimed by all who had the privilege of seeing it as Pincini's masterpiece."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac3f3300-d4f6-3440-8ca1-ba89978f94e3",
                                        "entry_id": "6c78eb4b-8825-34e1-b806-bf7f0bae66dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To salute or praise with great approval; to compliment; to applaud; to welcome enthusiastically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69450e92-490d-35d9-b452-3660118c47d7",
                                        "entry_id": "6c78eb4b-8825-34e1-b806-bf7f0bae66dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To claim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "350895e1-a0fa-3c54-a954-32d13e4f8b28",
                                        "entry_id": "6c78eb4b-8825-34e1-b806-bf7f0bae66dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To declare by acclamations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0969dfef-6509-404b-b75b-fa8ed003c695",
                                                "sense_id": "350895e1-a0fa-3c54-a954-32d13e4f8b28",
                                                "text": "Thou ſhalt be crown'd— / An Iron Crown, intenſely hot, ſhall gird / Thy hoary Temples; while the ſhouting Crowd / Acclaims thee King of Traitors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0af35ede-a54c-3e15-a157-c132cb9e2458",
                                        "entry_id": "6c78eb4b-8825-34e1-b806-bf7f0bae66dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To elect (a politician, etc.) to an office automatically because no other candidates run; elect by acclamation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d15b015e-f948-43af-b354-089b5c69929c",
                        "source_entry_id": "af327283-ec4b-3a77-bc1d-0a18a50141bf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f754edb2-28bd-34d4-8d63-750f403effe0",
                        "target_lang_word": "acclamation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "acclamation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0596952d-da80-3e7e-86a8-97b37b5101c1",
                                        "entry_id": "353d1309-af2c-3b7e-aae9-a2535595a9ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shout of approbation, favor, or assent; eager expression of approval; loud applause."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83e3c7d6-c474-4de3-b7c6-b19a21b2ce17",
                                                "sense_id": "0596952d-da80-3e7e-86a8-97b37b5101c1",
                                                "text": "Sometimes a member nominates a chairman and no vote is taken, the assembly signifying their approval by acclamation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f30a5e3-1678-41f1-ad52-39c2faf2627f",
                                                "sense_id": "0596952d-da80-3e7e-86a8-97b37b5101c1",
                                                "text": "On such a day, a holyday having been voted by acclamation, an ordinary walk would not satisfy the children:..it must be a scramble among the mountains, and I must accompany them; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eded027f-4d49-36b3-8e1a-2622352cac9c",
                                        "entry_id": "353d1309-af2c-3b7e-aae9-a2535595a9ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of winning an election to a post because there were no other candidates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fccd6e3f-9ab7-4dce-9db3-01f717f6ee81",
                                                "sense_id": "eded027f-4d49-36b3-8e1a-2622352cac9c",
                                                "text": "See also: uncontested, by default"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6993e718-fe38-451f-b543-a560619c329b",
                                                "sense_id": "eded027f-4d49-36b3-8e1a-2622352cac9c",
                                                "text": "With no one running against her, she won by acclamation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6355453a-a653-3828-8294-62af7140b837",
                                        "entry_id": "353d1309-af2c-3b7e-aae9-a2535595a9ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A representation, in sculpture or on medals, of people expressing joy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eb06f95-23c8-4656-9eb9-9d391afbd4ec",
                                                "sense_id": "6355453a-a653-3828-8294-62af7140b837",
                                                "text": "The medals on which laudatory acclamations are recorded are called by antiquaries acclamation medals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d486879d-8475-3327-9d68-02d9ebb23382",
                                        "entry_id": "353d1309-af2c-3b7e-aae9-a2535595a9ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An oral vote taken without formal ballot and with much fanfare; typically an overwhelmingly affirmative vote."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f52e3f48-47df-49a2-a528-5553c365576d",
                        "source_entry_id": "af327283-ec4b-3a77-bc1d-0a18a50141bf",
                        "source_sense_id": "f754edb2-28bd-34d4-8d63-750f403effe0",
                        "target_lang_word": "approbation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "approbation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05452f6a-3d61-3f6b-bc5c-1f9594e6db2f",
                                        "entry_id": "5249b8ba-f726-3ad5-b6b3-fda143eb5d11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agrément qu’on donne à quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5322f045-1190-459e-9677-7c249769e93d",
                                                "sense_id": "05452f6a-3d61-3f6b-bc5c-1f9594e6db2f",
                                                "text": "Vous recherchez moins mon avis sur le parti que vous avez à prendre que mon approbation pour celui que vous avez pris."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8e7a2cf-3e04-40b5-9247-cd244412015f",
                                                "sense_id": "05452f6a-3d61-3f6b-bc5c-1f9594e6db2f",
                                                "text": "Cette décision est confirmée par Clotaire II. Malgré l'approbation royale, elle ne fut sans doute pas rigoureusement appliquée, car le concile de Reims (615) dut la renouveler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cd5cc25-8c7e-4f03-8945-4f9592986fb1",
                                                "sense_id": "05452f6a-3d61-3f6b-bc5c-1f9594e6db2f",
                                                "text": "Ces clauses jouent généralement lorsque l'entreprise est proche de la faillite. Toutefois, l’application de ces clauses est subordonnée à des garanties d'emploi et à l’approbation du syndicat et de la fédération d’employeurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c593a8bc-1f77-316d-853d-5eee73519aff",
                                        "entry_id": "5249b8ba-f726-3ad5-b6b3-fda143eb5d11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jugement favorable qu’on porte de quelqu’un, de quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f64a54a9-4f46-426f-a1ab-7bcd1f160f42",
                                                "sense_id": "c593a8bc-1f77-316d-853d-5eee73519aff",
                                                "text": "Staline ne supporte que l'approbation; il tient pour adversaires tous ceux qui n'applaudissent pas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93c5b642-3495-4853-80f3-f88b17b7e3c8",
                                                "sense_id": "c593a8bc-1f77-316d-853d-5eee73519aff",
                                                "text": "L’approbation a tellement moins de nuances que le dénigrement !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
